flowchart TB
  C[Customer browser] --> N[Next.js Storefront]
  O[Admin operator] --> A[Angular Control Portal]
  N --> G[ASP.NET Core 10 Gateway/BFF - if justified]
  G --> CAT[Catalog ASP.NET Core 10]
  G --> OFF[Offers ASP.NET Core 10]
  G --> CART[Cart ASP.NET Core 10]
  G --> CHECK[Checkout ASP.NET Core 10]
  CHECK --> INV[Inventory ASP.NET Core 10]
  CHECK --> PAY[Payments ASP.NET Core 10]
  CAT --> MC[(MongoDB owners + outbox)]
  INV --> MI[(MongoDB owners + outbox)]
  PAY --> MP[(MongoDB owners + outbox)]
  A --> ADM[ASP.NET Core 10 Control Modular Monolith]
  ADM -->|Authenticated gRPC command| CAT
  ADM -->|Authenticated gRPC command| OFF
  ADM -->|Authenticated gRPC command| INV
  ADM --> MA[(Control own MongoDB)]
  MC --> CDC[Mongo Change Streams / CDC]
  MI --> CDC
  MP --> CDC
  CDC --> K[(Kafka)]
  K --> PR[C# Projection Workers]
  PR --> PG[(PostgreSQL read models)]
  G --> PG
  G --> R[(Redis cache)]
  G --> AI[Microsoft Agent Framework C# Assistant]
  AI -->|Typed read-only tools| CAT
  AI -->|Typed read-only tools| OFF
  AI -->|Proposal ONLY| G
  G -->|UI-approved cart command| CART
  K --> TASK[.NET Task Bridge]
  TASK --> Q[(RabbitMQ)]
  Q --> W[.NET Worker Services]
  IAM[Keycloak OIDC + workload identity] -.-> G
  IAM -.-> ADM
  IAM -.-> AI
  OT[OpenTelemetry + Grafana stack] -.-> G
  OT -.-> ADM
  OT -.-> PR
  OT -.-> AI
